<view class="page-container data-v-a7dc6c0a" style="{{'padding-top:'+(totalTopHeight+'px')+';'}}"><view class="form-card data-v-a7dc6c0a"><view class="upload-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><view class="image-grid data-v-a7dc6c0a"><block wx:for="{{viewImageSlots}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:for-index="index" wx:key="index"><view class="image-slot data-v-a7dc6c0a"><block wx:if="{{item.url}}"><view class="image-wrapper data-v-a7dc6c0a"><image class="preview-image data-v-a7dc6c0a" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['deleteImage',['view',index]]]]]}}" class="delete-btn data-v-a7dc6c0a" bindtap="__e"><text class="delete-icon data-v-a7dc6c0a">×</text></view></view></block><block wx:else><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['uploadImage',['view',index]]]]]}}" class="upload-placeholder data-v-a7dc6c0a" bindtap="__e"><text class="placeholder-icon data-v-a7dc6c0a">+</text><text class="placeholder-title data-v-a7dc6c0a">{{item.title}}</text></view></block></view></block></view></view><view class="upload-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><view class="image-grid data-v-a7dc6c0a"><block wx:for="{{detailImageSlots}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:for-index="index" wx:key="index"><view class="image-slot data-v-a7dc6c0a"><block wx:if="{{item.url}}"><view class="image-wrapper data-v-a7dc6c0a"><image class="preview-image data-v-a7dc6c0a" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['deleteImage',['detail',index]]]]]}}" class="delete-btn data-v-a7dc6c0a" bindtap="__e"><text class="delete-icon data-v-a7dc6c0a">×</text></view></view></block><block wx:else><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['uploadImage',['detail',index]]]]]}}" class="upload-placeholder data-v-a7dc6c0a" bindtap="__e"><text class="placeholder-icon data-v-a7dc6c0a">+</text><text class="placeholder-title data-v-a7dc6c0a">{{item.title}}</text></view></block></view></block></view></view><view class="agreement-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['toggleAgree',['$event']]]]]}}" class="agreement-check data-v-a7dc6c0a" bindtap="__e"><view class="{{['checkbox','data-v-a7dc6c0a',(agreed)?'checked':'']}}"><block wx:if="{{agreed}}"><uni-icons vue-id="53b0132a-1" type="checkmarkempty" size="14" color="#fff" class="data-v-a7dc6c0a" bind:__l="__l"></uni-icons></block></view><text class="agreement-text data-v-a7dc6c0a"> 我已阅读并同意 <text data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['showAgreement',['$event']]]]]}}" class="agreement-link data-v-a7dc6c0a" catchtap="__e">《同城圈广告发布协议》</text></text></view></view><button class="submit-btn data-v-a7dc6c0a" loading="{{isSubmitting}}" data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['handleSubmit',['$event']]]]]}}" bindtap="__e">{{''+(isSubmitting?'提交中...':'确定')+''}}</button></view><uni-popup vue-id="53b0132a-2" type="bottom" border-radius="20rpx 20rpx 0 0" data-ref="agreePopup" class="data-v-a7dc6c0a vue-ref" bind:__l="__l" vue-slots="{{['default']}}"><view class="agree-popup data-v-a7dc6c0a"><view class="agree-header data-v-a7dc6c0a"><text class="agree-title data-v-a7dc6c0a">同城圈广告发布协议</text><text data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['e0',['$event']]]]]}}" class="agree-close data-v-a7dc6c0a" bindtap="__e">×</text></view><scroll-view class="agree-content data-v-a7dc6c0a" scroll-y="{{true}}"><view class="agree-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><text class="agree-text data-v-a7dc6c0a">第一条 协议说明</text><text class="agree-detail data-v-a7dc6c0a">本协议是您与同城圈平台之间就发布门店广告事宜所订立的具有法律约束力的协议。您确认并同意本协议内容后，方可在同城圈平台发布广告。</text></view><view class="agree-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><text class="agree-text data-v-a7dc6c0a">第二条 广告内容规范</text><text class="agree-detail data-v-a7dc6c0a">1. 广告内容必须真实、合法、健康，不得含有虚假、误导性信息；\n2. 不得发布违反国家法律法规的广告内容；\n3. 不得发布涉及淫秽、暴力、迷信等不良信息的广告；\n4. 广告图片需清晰、完整，不得带有水印或无关元素。</text></view><view class="agree-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><text class="agree-text data-v-a7dc6c0a">第三条 知识产权声明</text><text class="agree-detail data-v-a7dc6c0a">1. 您保证所发布的广告内容、图片拥有合法的知识产权或使用权；\n2. 因侵权引起的一切法律责任由您自行承担；\n3. 您授予同城圈平台在广告展示期间免费使用您所发布内容的权利。</text></view><view class="agree-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><text class="agree-text data-v-a7dc6c0a">第四条 审核与发布</text><text class="agree-detail data-v-a7dc6c0a">1. 同城圈平台有权对您提交的广告内容进行审核；\n2. 审核通过后广告方可正式发布；\n3. 审核时间一般为1-3个工作日；\n4. 平台保留对广告内容进行修改或拒绝发布的权利。</text></view><view class="agree-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><text class="agree-text data-v-a7dc6c0a">第五条 费用与结算</text><text class="agree-detail data-v-a7dc6c0a">1. 广告发布需支付相应费用，具体以平台公示为准；\n2. 费用一经缴纳，除平台原因外不予退还；\n3. 广告发布期间，您需确保账户余额充足。</text></view><view class="agree-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><text class="agree-text data-v-a7dc6c0a">第六条 违约处理</text><text class="agree-detail data-v-a7dc6c0a">1. 如您违反本协议，平台有权立即终止广告发布；\n2. 因您的违约行为给平台或第三方造成损失的，您需承担全部赔偿责任；\n3. 平台有权将您的违约行为通报相关部门。</text></view><view class="agree-section data-v-a7dc6c0a"><text class="agree-text data-v-a7dc6c0a">第七条 其他条款</text><text class="agree-detail data-v-a7dc6c0a">1. 本协议自您签署之日起生效；\n2. 本协议解释权归同城圈平台所有；\n3. 如您对协议内容有异议，请停止使用平台服务。</text></view></scroll-view><view class="agree-bottom data-v-a7dc6c0a"><button data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['agreeAndClose',['$event']]]]]}}" class="agree-btn data-v-a7dc6c0a" bindtap="__e">我已阅读并同意</button></view></view></uni-popup></view>